WEBVTT

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.310
Big news, everyone!

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:09.550
It looks like an anime featuring
Handa-kun is going to start!

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:13.920
What?!

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:18.180
So, the media finally took notice of Handa-san...

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:18.360
Handa Force
Secret HQ

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:20.210
A bit late, if you ask me.

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:22.880
At least that anime studio's got good taste.

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:27.160
I've heard of dramas based on people
who have done great deeds, but...

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.670
...why a normal high-school
student like Handa-kun?

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:32.500
Don't lump Handa in with any
normal high school student!

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:37.050
From what I heard, a certain publisher's
mysterious organization took mysterious action,

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:37.120
mysterious contract

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.990
and a contract was mysteriously entered into,

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:39.050
Project Launch

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:41.520
and by the time anyone noticed,
a mysterious project came to be.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.980
Leave it to Handa-san with all his mysteries!

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:48.030
Is it going to be a standard fare anime
about a popular school student?

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:49.490
In the first place, what is it about?

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:56.730
I bet it's going to go all out
on Handa-san's manliness.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.110
Grrrrrr!

00:00:58.110 --> 00:00:58.600
But Handa-san is kind, so...

00:00:58.600 --> 00:00:59.470
Spew

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:00.450
Nothing
to be
scared of,
he's just
frightened

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:02.180
Is this what Handa-kun is like?

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:05.190
Nowadays, no one watches
manly anime like that.

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:06.100
What?!

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:07.490
Then what do you think it's gonna be?!

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:12.550
Isn't it obvious? It's going to be a stylish,
fashionable, mature romance anime.

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:16.830
Grab! Stop!

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:21.150
And that will mark the beginning of love!

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:24.770
The visual in the last part was pretty spooky...

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:28.890
Handa's chic and snazzy, so I think
he would do well in places like France.

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:30.130
True...

00:01:30.130 --> 00:01:33.050
If we can flatter them, he may get
an invitation to the Japan Expo.

00:01:33.050 --> 00:01:34.020
Underhanded!

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:37.170
But what defines Handa-kun is calligraphy.

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:38.400
Th-That's right.

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:39.800
Let's use this Japanese culture as a means
to get him invited to the Japan Expo.

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:41.060
France

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:41.450
Still underhanded!

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:42.380
France

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:46.200
The more you think about it, the more you
can't tell what the anime is going to be about.

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:47.810
How about this?

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:53.750
A sci-fi where he fights monsters and aliens.

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:57.510
A fantasy where he flies the skies on a dragon!

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:00.960
A historic fantasy where he
wields his sword against enemies!

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:03.840
Let's be a bit more serious here!

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:06.490
Handa-kun is a normal high-school student.

00:02:06.490 --> 00:02:08.070
I bet it'll be a school drama.

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:12.510
He'll be a simple, yet thoughtful and
shy boy who's worried about attention.

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:16.060
Yuki-kun? You...

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:16.610
Huh?

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:18.430
Just because you're an average Joe

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:21.490
doesn't mean you should dream of
Handa-kun being an average Joe, too!

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.280
Know your place! Handa-san is
the exact opposite of you!

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:27.010
Well, there goes my confidence...

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:29.850
C'mon, we can find out what it's about in here.

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:31.090
Huh? What's the title?

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:32.110
It's "handa-kun."

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:35.540
Hm? It looks like the first
episode already aired...

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:36.120
What?

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:37.480
It can't be...

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:41.200
None of us on the Handa Force
had any information on the anime?

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:43.250
This can't be happening...

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:45.210
Y-You're right...

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:47.790
Maybe someone subconsciously recorded it.

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:50.060
Those who think you recorded it.

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:52.270
Those who actually recorded it.

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:57.320
I can't believe none of you three recorded it!

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:59.180
Not watching in real time is a shame, too!

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:01.090
You guys are a disgrace to the Handa Force!

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:02.440
You too!

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:05.700
Say, maybe Nise-kun or Dash recorded it.

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:06.690
I see!

00:03:07.150 --> 00:03:10.040
Hey, Nise-kun? About Handa-kun's anime...

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:13.840
Huh? I'm talking about the anime.
What do you have to do with it?

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:16.760
Voice actor? Of course you're not
going to be called! Are you dense?!

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:19.890
Nise-kun isn't good as a human being.

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:22.200
Seems like he thought he
would appear in the anime.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.640
I'll bet on the next one.

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:25.400
Hello? Dash?

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:25.900
About Handa-kun's...

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:27.190
Don't bet on Dash...

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:29.340
All he thinks about is running.

00:03:30.970 --> 00:03:32.350
Huh?! You know the character song?!

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:35.140
No! That's the "Haneda Marathon"!

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:36.790
Handa character song!

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:37.860
Never mind already!

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:40.790
No good! Nise-kun and Dash
were both useless, as expected!

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:45.270
Compared to them, a shit-eating
dung beetle is more competent!

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:46.850
You serious?

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:48.720
I think Eraser may know about it...

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:52.040
We're going to be erased if she finds out
about the Handa Force's blunder...

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:52.990
Y-Yeah...

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:56.490
Why don't we contact the development studio?

00:03:56.490 --> 00:03:58.790
Huh?! We want to be this much of a nuisance?!

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:02.380
Don't worry! We're like a
part of Handa-kun's family.

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:05.050
Hello? Is this diomedéa?

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:08.340
I'm calling in behalf of the Handa Force
handling the management of Handa-kun.

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:10.160
Management...?

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:12.980
We believe it's either your
studio or TV station's mistake,

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:15.770
but we couldn't watch the first episode,

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.750
so can you please rebroadcast
or restart it starting this week?

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:19.270
Huh...? Impossible...?

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:20.900
Well, that's weird!

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:24.160
After what you have done with
Handa-kun without us in the loop?!

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.690
Speaking with you is going nowhere.

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:26.550
I demand to speak with the Director!

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:27.320
S-Stop already...

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:28.040
I'm already up to here with...

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:30.040
Any longer and you'll sound
like some baseless complainer.

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:31.130
Hello...? Hello?!

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:32.350
Tch! He cut the call!

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:33.470
What'd you expect?

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:34.870
What did they say?

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:36.550
What a terrible company!

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:39.810
They said to watch episode 1 through
on-demand or on the DVD to come!

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:41.880
Come on, we're the Handa Force!

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:45.920
No way can we have a company that doesn't pay
respect to the Handa Force handle Handa-san.

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:49.740
Well then, why don't we
make the right Handa anime?

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:50.680
Sounds good!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:54.590
If we're going to do it, we may as well
perfect it and sell it to the other stations!

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:57.560
Now that it's settled,
let's get the talents together!

00:04:58.930 --> 00:04:59.270
Even if it's the student council president
or Takoyaki-kun, get everyone together!

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:02.130
Yup... You don't want to get involved in this.

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:02.230
Handa Name List
Yup... You don't want to get involved in this.

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.430
There's a lot of throwaway characters in here.
Handa Name List

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:04.880
Handa Name List

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:06.650
Say... Can I leave?
Handa Name List

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:06.710
Handa Name List

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:09.620
If we bring in the bishoujo otaku,
he'll be turned into a bishoujo!

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:10.840
How about the librarian, then?

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:11.840
How about the meat-eaters?

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:13.560
They sound a bit bothersome.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:14.510
Our battle has just begun!

00:05:14.510 --> 00:05:15.340
I'm going.
Our battle has just begun!

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:16.360
Our battle has just begun!

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:20.400
I'm really going.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:22.550
Just you wait, Handa-san!

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.070
Scenario

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:26.110
Character Design

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:28.210
Storyboard

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:28.820
The Handa Force continued
their work with others members

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:30.700
Original Art

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:31.770
Filming

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:32.780
in developing an anime featuring Handa-kun.

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:34.620
Post-Recording

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:36.080
Sound Effect Recording

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:36.620
Editing

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:38.910
A few days later

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:40.440
It's done.

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.340
This is the real "handa-kun"!

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:45.080
Don't care if it's diomedéa or TBS...

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:47.240
No one can create a title
better than the Handa Force!

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:49.610
Take to heart the seriousness
of the Handa Force!

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:52.860
Time to put it on screen!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.120
That's right...

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:57.360
I'm the only one seeing it for the first time.

00:05:57.910 --> 00:05:59.290
Watch in awe!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.560
Fully developed under the
direction of the Handa Force...

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.840
Handa-kun Forever!

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:06.940
Forever?

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:09.020
I can already smell the fail
and dark history to come!

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:12.010
Handa-kuuun!

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:13.850
Heeey.

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:15.550
Reo-pippi's drawing sucks!

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:19.760
Handa-kun's "H" is an "H"
as in " Handwriting"...

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:21.970
You made the opening, too?

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:23.700
Nise-kun wrote the lyrics.

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:25.010
Uh, okay.

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.870
Watch, it's the first plot point in the A-part.

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:31.430
It's a scene where Handa lands on Earth.

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:33.390
Handa isn't an earthling?

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:37.540
"The kind-hearted Handa Force adopts
Handa-kun who just arrived on Earth."

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:40.240
Adopts? He isn't some cat, you know?

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:44.170
"Handa-kun couldn't even stand up
because of the gravity on Earth, but..."

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:46.140
You made a realistic setting here?

00:06:46.140 --> 00:06:48.990
"...with the Handa Force's devoted support..."

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:50.530
"...he's like this now."

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:53.790
The drawing sucks so bad that
I can't tell what "like" means.

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:54.810
Huh?!

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:56.380
This isn't good.

00:06:56.380 --> 00:06:57.810
It doesn't convey anything.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.180
Did you draw this, Reo-kun?

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:01.390
Nope. I just did the character design.

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:04.550
I just had the Bishoujo Club
draw it based off of this.

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:06.900
No one complained about the character design?!

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:09.320
I can't believe how accurate
and professional they are...

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:10.530
Be quiet.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:13.270
We're close to the scene
where Handa-kun stands up.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:16.560
It's just some kind of grotesque image now!

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:18.380
"My name is Handa."

00:07:19.150 --> 00:07:20.920
Uh, is Nise-kun voicing this, too?

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:21.830
Yes.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:25.600
Sure he sounds like him, but you shouldn't
be using someone who reads without life.

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:28.470
We purposely went with a more raw voice, and...

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:31.660
Not good at all. There's no
empathy in the character.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:35.130
The voice has to be more
like Ya**************-san.

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:37.910
Using a novice like Nise-kun
won't get you anywhere.

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:40.360
Voicing and casting are important, you know.

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:42.470
You have to get that right.

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:42.930
Let me handle—

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:43.280
Shut up
Let me handle—

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:44.260
Shut up

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:46.940
For someone who's only watching,
that's a lot of complaining!

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:48.200
What are you, the writer?!

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:49.830
It's tough making anime!

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:52.080
Going around freely saying
the image isn't the same, eh?!

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:53.170
What are you, the writer?!

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:56.900
You have got some nerve! We're working
together to entertain everyone!

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:58.050
What are you, the writer?!

00:07:58.050 --> 00:08:00.080
Discussion over anime is intense, you know!

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.110
The pressure's in the air!

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:01.990
What are you, the—

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:06.080
Who is it?

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.790
I have a delivery.

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:08.760
Coming.

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:16.060
Can I get your stamp?

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:17.300
Eraser...

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.100
A signature would do, too.

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:19.990
Uh, okay...

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:23.550
The heck is this?

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:27.240
It's... from the "handa-kun"
development studio, diomedéa!

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:28.400
What?!

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:31.020
Maybe we're being sued for the
complaint call we made the last time.

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:32.150
Let's see...

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:36.900
We sincerely apologize to the Handa Force
for the delay in our report to you

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:39.790
despite your organization's
deep involvement with the anime.

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:40.890
Huh? They said that?

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:44.980
Wait, but the people out there
don't know the Handa Force.

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:47.650
We didn't even make ourselves public yet, and...

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:50.350
Never mind the details.

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:51.750
Is there anything else?

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.300
It's the first episode of "handa-kun"!

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:59.380
And it's the one without any commercials,
shared with only those involved!

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:01.190
Let's watch! Like, right now!

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:02.900
Start!

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:18.410
Just tell me! Too many choices to make...

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:20.990
What is the answer? More than I can handle...

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:23.330
I don't know anymore! Got too much liberty...

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:25.870
Just tell me!! Right now!!

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:28.750
Get my words, take my rights!

00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:31.130
Unable to put up with this inescapable reality,

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:31.250
Get my words, take my rights!
Unable to put up with this inescapable reality,

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.590
Get my words, take my rights!

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:36.050
Everyone's lying to themselves!

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:38.550
After all this grieving... wailing...

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:40.840
has something managed to change?

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:43.720
We run away before the fight even starts,

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:46.730
as a sorrowful yesterday enters refrain.

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:52.610
Get up now! These twised emotions have nowhere to go-

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:55.280
It's a problem everyone faces

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:57.740
unable to even sleep at night!

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:58.950
C'mon and Break down!

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:02.580
Abandon any half-assed resolutions!

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:07.370
Whether this future can be broken through, or not- you'll never know unless you try!

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:12.920
Searching for an answer, even questioning the times you live in,

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:17.300
No one is going to give you an answer!

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:23.100
So let loose that feeling engraved in your heart-

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:26.930
Choose your liberty... and take it in hand!

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:51.380
<i>"Handa-kun and a Girl's Friendship"</i>

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:52.500
Handa Sei...
<i>"Handa-kun and a Girl's Friendship"</i>

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:53.790
2nd-year high-school student...
<i>"Handa-kun and a Girl's Friendship"</i>

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:54.460
<i>"Handa-kun and a Girl's Friendship"</i>

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:57.550
His father, Handa Seimei,
is an authority on calligraphy...

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:01.180
He himself is a young genius,
well known in the world of calligraphy.

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:12.190
Everyone is hating on me as usual.

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:14.020
But don't worry...

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:18.070
I have no intention of
being friends with you all.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:20.570
No intention at all...

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:27.410
I was finally going to speak to him today,
but he's walled himself up already.

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.290
That's the rumored "Handa Wall."

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:37.460
My slippers were stolen a number
of times when I was in middle school.

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.920
Now I'm taking them home with me every day.

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:44.180
It's common for bullies
to first target the slippers.

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:51.850
A letter of misfortune?!

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:58.360
That's right... I recall getting
a lot back in middle school.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:05.200
But I didn't expect to gel a letter
of misfortune in high school...

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.700
The moment I read this,

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:12.790
I'll need to send out a letter with the same
content within a week to at least three others...

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:16.590
But... I don't even have three friends!

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:18.920
No, wait!

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:22.010
It's not like this is a letter of misfortune.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:23.630
Think...

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:26.720
What other reason would I get a letter?

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:29.100
A letter in a shoe cabinet...

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:31.350
A letter of challenge?!

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:32.770
He crushed the love letter!

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.400
I bet he's not into girls now!

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:38.320
I don't want to be called
out to the back of the gym.

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:40.320
I'll just pretend I didn't see it.

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:43.990
Hey, Handa... kun!

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:44.240
Stop, Juri-chan!

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:46.740
That's horrible, throwing it away like that!

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.990
Maiko spent the whole night writing that letter!

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:51.870
At least take a look at it!

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:54.500
That's fine! I'm okay!

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:56.670
Handa... kun!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:59.170
Stop being so conceited!

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:00.340
Shoot...
Stop already...

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:00.800
I threw it away in front of the sender.
Stop already...

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.380
I threw it away in front of the sender.

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:03.340
Say something!

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:04.090
What's she thinking of,
writing a letter of challenge to me?

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:06.300
Stop...!

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:10.970
Well, I suppose a girl wouldn't
punch me all of a sudden.

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:14.390
I guess it's best for me
to at least hear her out.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:17.190
Is there something you want to say to me?

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:20.570
Huh? Here?

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:22.070
I have to say it out in the open?

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:25.070
C'mon Maiko. Say it!

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:27.870
Take that!

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:30.490
I bet she can't harass me
with everyone around.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.910
Please come to the back
of the gym after school!

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:35.500
She still called me out!

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:36.920
You did it, Maiko!

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:39.670
Damn it...!

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:42.630
I vowed to not read any letters
that were in my shoe cabinet...

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:45.420
What's going to happen to me?

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:47.930
Route 1

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:50.890
You're pretty sad, you know?

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:55.770
Surrounded by girls, and relentlessly
ravaged by their words?

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:58.850
Route 2

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:01.980
The hell you doin' starin' at my girl, eh?!

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:03.780
Her boyfriend is the leader of a biker gang

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:04.780
Show him his place, Ma-kun.

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:07.990
who'll beat me up at some run-down factory?

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.910
I need to do something before school ends!

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:15.790
Handa-kun's aura is a lot
more intense than usual.

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:19.290
I should have just pretended I didn't even find it.

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:25.300
Having her declare in front of everyone
made it impossible for me to run.

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:29.640
Don't run. Don't run. Don't run. Don't run!

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:33.010
If I run now, I'll be called a spineless pig
and bullied for the rest of my life!

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:37.180
I still have time!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:39.600
First, I need to calm down...

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:46.360
Handa-kun? Class is in session.

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:51.280
I need to find a way to speak with her
one-on-one before school ends.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:52.620
Huh?

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.660
What's her name?

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:55.910
Handa, you have got some
nerve disregarding me!

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:57.500
She's not in this class.
Handa, you have got some
nerve disregarding me!

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:57.830
Handa, you have got some
nerve disregarding me!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.370
Ah... The large one that was with her is here.

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:02.250
What's she doing staring at me?!

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.040
Handa-kun!

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:04.630
Uh...

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:06.630
I know you're a calligrapher,

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:07.090
but I can't turn a blind eye if
you're being negligent in class.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.170
Dang it...

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:09.970
The teacher's upset for some reason.

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:12.550
Solve the question up there.

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:13.640
Huh...

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:15.430
What...?

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:17.850
Everyone's all smirking...

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.770
They're expecting me to get it wrong...

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:24.520
Too bad for them, I'm good at math!

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:30.450
Stop, Handa-kun! I got it! I'm sorry
to have bothered your calligraphy!

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.530
Wow, it's really ink.

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.660
Handa-kun was so cool.

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:39.410
Maiko-chan is our idol, but if
it's Handa, we won't mind.

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:43.130
So, the birth of a sweet couple,
Handa-kun and Mori Maiko...

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:45.420
Sure hope they end up happy together.

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:48.260
I can't remember her name...

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:49.670
Not a clue.

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:54.090
I could find out if I ask
that girl that was with her...

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:56.310
...but I don't think I'll get along with her.

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:58.020
She's still staring?

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.560
Is she trying to pick a fight with me, too?

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:02.190
I'm not giving in!

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:07.650
What the...? Handa's been
staring at me the whole time...

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:08.730
Seriously, what's his problem?

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:12.280
I have to find a way to call that girl
without getting involved with her.

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.320
I'll write a letter!

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:18.120
I just have to tell her to
have that other girl read it.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:22.460
What am I thinking? Maiko is
the one who's in love with Handa.

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:26.340
Coming from me as a girl, I think Maiko is cute.

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:31.550
If she confesses her love, even the
"Lone Man Handa" would keel over.

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:38.890
Still, I should have at least tried to
make a confession to Handa... kun.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:39.510
Hey.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:50.190
Wha—?! What?! What all of
a sudden?! This, for me?!

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:53.740
Nah, it can't be for me...

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:56.110
I'm used to being just a messenger to Maiko...

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:56.370
Read it alone
I'm used to being just a messenger to Maiko...

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:57.320
Read it alone

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:00.370
That should do it.

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:05.580
I carefully worded that I'll be waiting
for her in the back of the school building.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:10.210
The only thing left is to
hope she accepts my offer.

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:13.840
I hope I can end this through discussion...

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:24.350
Exquisite!

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:28.150
Huh? What? Am I just too stupid?

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:30.980
Come on, there's no way a
high-school girl could read this!

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:32.860
No! I'm going to read this!

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:36.740
I need to at least know what
this letter from Handa... kun says!

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:39.120
This word...

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:42.240
Li... ke...?

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:44.120
It's a love letter?!

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:49.000
It can't be! A love letter
from Handa... kun to me?!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.840
But now that I look at it...

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:53.260
"Face"... "Body"... "Love"...

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:55.880
It looks like those characters are in here.

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:58.430
Damn it...

00:17:58.430 --> 00:17:59.680
Why...?

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:02.060
Why me?

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:07.190
Me, betray Maiko...?

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:13.860
You're such a devil, Handa Sei...

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:15.360
He sneezed.

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:19.200
I wonder if my letter of plea got to her...

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:21.120
I'm not so sure now...

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:23.240
No, Maiko is... But...!

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:25.950
I mean, Friend A over there is getting all weird...

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:26.620
Handa-kun? Can you answer this question?

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:28.670
Being called out after school is a...

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:29.920
...waste of time.

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:31.840
You meanie!

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:34.210
Handa-kun is sure relentless!

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:36.300
Teacher, please don't hold back the class.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:37.260
sigh

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:39.260
"Lunch Break"

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:42.680
Juri-chan, let's eat our bento.

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:44.470
Uh, yeah...

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:46.810
Shoot! If Handa sees this...!

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:47.480
He's away!

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:49.350
Did you bring your bento?

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:52.690
Bento, right... I have it with me.

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:57.280
Wow! That's such a cute bento!

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:58.650
It's like pearls before swine!

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:00.610
Hm?! Did she casually say something horrible?

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:02.950
Wow! This is so cute!

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:07.830
Ah! That's my rockhopper penguin rice ball!

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:09.370
Thanks so much!

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:11.880
Juri-chan is like a mom to me.

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:13.210
Uh, right...

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:17.050
What's with her?!
She's pissing me off!

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:19.930
Wow! You're so strong.

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:24.890
Come to think of it, I don't have any
fun memories of being with Maiko.

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:28.980
Say, Maiko? I wonder why we're friends.

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:31.440
Hm? That came out of nowhere.

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:34.940
You can make cuter friends
than me, right, Maiko?

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:38.110
Come on, is that what you think, Juri-chan?

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:41.450
I'm at ease when I'm around you, Juri-chan.

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:44.070
Maiko!

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:49.250
Like, I don't wanna be a stepping
stool for girls cuter than me.

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:52.370
I can't let this girl get her hands on Handa-kun!

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:58.050
Lunch break has ended.

00:19:58.550 --> 00:20:00.260
Let's do our best in our afternoon session.

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:05.640
Why... isn't she here?!

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:06.930
"5th Period"

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:08.600
Why?! The letter!

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:10.060
Didn't she get the letter?!

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:11.600
Handa-kun.

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:13.400
Guess you're not listening...

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:13.850
"6th Pernod"

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:16.060
School is going to end real soon!
"6th Pernod"

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:18.480
Handa! Let's stop for a second!

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:19.650
Okay? Okay?!

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:24.070
Should I go?

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:25.820
Can I run?

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:28.030
No...

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:29.580
It was behind the gym, right?

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.040
Handa-kun's still here.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.750
It doesn't look like I can get away...
He'll probably leave soon.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:32.910
Well, we'll be going on ahead.
It doesn't look like I can get away...

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:34.040
Well, we'll be going on ahead.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:37.670
It seems like there's going to
be a crowd behind the gym.

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:48.470
I can't even imagine what's
going to happen to me...

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:50.140
But...

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:57.020
It can't be helped...

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:23.590
The man, Handa Sei...

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:28.430
...is ready!

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:31.220
To be continued

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:33.100
Huh? To be continued?!

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:34.940
What a place to end...

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:39.230
Maybe it's because you guys
wasted all that time in the first half.

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:41.860
Seems like they just finished it
to see how it looks.

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:43.110
That came out arrogant...

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:45.400
What should we do with the anime we made?

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:48.620
It's at least stuffed with affection...

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:51.990
But after seeing the real deal...

00:21:54.910 --> 00:21:56.080
Still...

00:21:56.870 --> 00:21:59.790
We should return Handa-san
to Handa-san, right?

00:22:00.840 --> 00:22:01.800
I see.

00:22:03.840 --> 00:22:04.590
You're right.

00:22:07.680 --> 00:22:09.010
You really shouldn't...

00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:21.610
Don't look for me- Don't look for me-

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:24.900
I'd rather not register in anyone's gaze,

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:31.080
'Cause I'm still not settled into this world.

00:22:33.140 --> 00:22:36.960
Though I'm so transient, I've always said,

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:42.210
"Someday, this unfair way of living will come back to bite me!"

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:46.470
'Cause what I really want,

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:50.180
Is to be laughing along with everyone else!

00:22:50.260 --> 00:22:54.140
My HIDE-AND-SEEK continues...

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:58.400
My voice still can't make a sound,

00:23:00.640 --> 00:23:05.990
But I wonder if I can communicate this... all my thoughts and feelings!

00:23:05.990 --> 00:23:11.160
I can always hear it in the distance...

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:18.830
And someday, I'd like to once again answer that call.

00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:22.040
The day when I'll be told, "It's alright, you've done all you can,"

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:26.300
May be closer to arribing than I thought.

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:41.060
Handa-kun's "N" is the "N" in the moaning
noise he makes when he's worried, "Nngh!"

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:44.770
"Handa Family"

00:23:44.770 --> 00:23:48.820
Handa-kun's "D" is the "D"
in "Da-da-da-da-da!"

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:52.860
Make it black! Dye the flag!
Drug store's got a mask, good luck!

00:23:52.860 --> 00:23:56.620
Good truck and a good track!
The truck competition's gonna seriously dash!

00:23:56.620 --> 00:24:00.960
Soooo! Chaaaasing the truck...

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:01.540
...running—

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:05.380
Next time... "Handa-kun and
the Continuation of Episode 1.

00:24:05.380 --> 00:24:07.130
Handa-kun and the Chairperson.

00:24:07.130 --> 00:24:08.840
Handa-kun and the Model."

00:24:08.840 --> 00:24:09.710
See you again.
